    "detailed_description": "Encounters is a First-Person, open-world exploration game where you work as a government agent whose job is to use tools to track and gather information on possible threats. After strange radar readings and reports in a small isolated town, you are tasked with determining the validity of these reports<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEarn money by collecting supernatural evidence (Taking photos, Collecting radioactive material, Player Reports) of cryptids and aliens<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpend that money on more advanced means of detection (Live Cameras, Radio Anmoly Detector) or player upgrades (Compass, Binoculars, Flashlight)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the open world and find all the secrets<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut watch out for each entity has unique behaviour<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you get the the bottom of what's happening in this small town?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDay/Night Cycle<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPickup and stow system<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic outdoor ambiance<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIngame printable pictures<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDrivable Truck",
